WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.559
For the review, know the major divisions and their order. Precambrian

00:00:04.559 --> 00:00:07.620
comes first and includes most of Earth's history.

00:00:08.433 --> 00:00:12.519
Next is the Paleozoic, with diverse life in the seas and

00:00:12.519 --> 00:00:13.633
expanding onto land.

00:00:15.933 --> 00:00:19.353
Then comes the Mesozoic, the era that includes the dinosaurs.

00:00:23.433 --> 00:00:27.539
Cenozoic is youngest. Remember the four broad blocks; he did not

00:00:27.539 --> 00:00:30.151
ask you to memorize every period name.
